    "updated_at": "2021-03-11T19:36:24Z",
    "body": "Parallel queues don't actually help in this case, because the whole point of \"queue a task\" is to synchronize across threads.\r\n\r\n... That did make me notice that parallel queues themselves could use some \"atomically\" in the operations that enqueue and dequeue.",
